  "instructions": [
    "heat the vegetable oil in a wok or large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "add the garlic and ginger and stir-fry for 30 seconds.",
    "add the charlotte potatoes and stir-fry for 5 minutes.",
    "add the soy sauce, honey, and sesame oil, and stir-fry for 2 minutes.",
    "add the salt and pepper to taste.",
    "add the mozzarella cheese and stir-fry until melted and stringy.",
    "add the chopped scallion and stir-fry for 1 minute.",
    "meanwhile, cook the pandan leaves in a steamer or microwave for 30 seconds to 1 minute.",
    "wrap the stir-fry in a pandan leaf and serve hot.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
